title: tom_NPCDialogue
---
<<declare $dialogPhase = "">>
<<setPhase tom>>
<<if $dialogPhase == "begin">>
    <<jump tom_Start>>
<<else>>
    <<jump tom_Questions>>
<<endif>>
===

title: tom_Start
---
Tom: Hey Mike, do you need something?
Player: Sorry for barging in.
<<getPhase tom "comeback">>
<<jump tom_Questions>>
===

title: tom_Questions
---
-> I knocked and you didnʼt answer
    Tom: Oh yeah, I was listening to music I didnʼt hear you
    <<jump tom_Questions>>
-> I wanted to talk to you about what you meant yesterday
    Player: Why did you tell me not to open the door? How did you know that something was wrong?
    Tom: Look thereʼs a lot about me you donʼt know. But I know the RA, heʼs not a good person he likes scaring the new students.
    <<jump tom_Questions>>
-> Do you know Jack?
    Tom: Yeah of course, he lives next door. I texted him yesterday too but he didnʼt answer.
    <<jump tom_Questions>>
-> What do you know about Bob?
    Tom: Bob? Bob is dead, he died yesterday night, didnʼt you see? He was right in front of you.
    Player: How do you know
    Tom: You told me of course! You came into my room yesterday just to tell me. You said you think Bob is dead, donʼt you remember?
    Player: I donʼt know what you are talking about, where is he right now?
    Tom: He's probably on the second floor bathroom taking a shower.
    Player: You just said he was dead though?
    <<jump tom_Questions>>
-> That will be all.
    Are you sure? (You will not be able to return to this conversation.)
    -> Yes
        Tom: Alright I have a meeting so I gotta go, if you want to hang out a bit longer you can stay, but remember to lock the door when you leave.
        <<getPhase tom "departed">>
        <<stop>>
    -> No
        <<jump tom_Questions>>
===
